      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Individual range request status, getStatus(). Indicates that the ranging operation failed because the peer is busy and unable to handle the request at this time. The requester should try again after a suggested delay, which can be retrieved with getRetryAfterDurationMillis().</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/wifi/rtt/RangingResult#STATUS_BUSY_TRY_LATER" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.net.wifi.rtt.RangingResult.STATUS_BUSY_TRY_LATER</code>.</a></format></para>
